<h3><u>Maula mera vi ghar howe</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>Maula...<br />
Rahe dil mein salamat ye ghum tera<br />
Na ghum ho koi is ghum ke siwa<br />
manzoor karo shahe karbobala<br />
har momin ke ye dil ki dua<br />
ye dil ki dua, ye dil ki dua<br />
maula mera vi ghar howe, uthe alma di chaa howe..(2)</p>

<p>maula mera vi ghar howe, uthe alma di chaa howe<br />
zikr zehra de laa laa&#39;nda, mere ghar vi bayaa&#39;n howe<br />
maula mera vi ghar howe, uthe alma di chaa howe..(2)</p>

<p>1. Chade jad chand moharram da<br />
safe matam bichawa&#39;n mai<br />
gharche zakir bulawaa&#39;n mai<br />
teri majlis karawaa&#39;n mai<br />
zuljanah garcho&#39;n jad nikle<br />
jag girya kuna howe<br />
maula mera vi ghar howe, uthe alma di chaa howe..(2)</p>

<p>2. Dukhi zainab jo na kita<br />
tera matam karawaa&#39;n mai<br />
teri phoodi bichawaa&#39;n mai<br />
othe langar pakawaa&#39;n mai<br />
azadari le ee maula<br />
koi aisi witha howe<br />
maula mera vi ghar howe, uthe alma di chaa howe..(2)</p>

<p>3. Azakhana mere ghar bane<br />
jithe masoom awandge<br />
payr pawandge jadd wede<br />
paag mere jagawandge<br />
panja baara te chauda di<br />
uthe sibto sanaa howe<br />
maula mera vi ghar howe, uthe alma di chaa howe..(2)</p>

<p>4. Maula menu mile je ghar<br />
jhula asghar sajawaa&#39;n mai<br />
aap laawa&#39;n sabeela mai<br />
sabnu pani piyawaa&#39;n mai<br />
jithe mashke sakina howe<br />
ghazi da nishaa&#39;n howe<br />
maula mera vi ghar howe, uthe alma di chaa howe..(2)</p>

<p>5. Mere ghar jo baramad howe<br />
jaddo taboot beemar daa<br />
yaad kar maula sajjad nu<br />
rowe dil har azaadar daa<br />
sadqa beemar sajjad daa<br />
maaf har ek gunaah howe<br />
maula mera vi ghar howe, uthe alma di chaa howe..(2)</p>

<p>6. Menu milya jo hai ghum tera<br />
nasl dar nasl milda rawe<br />
panjetan di mohabbat daa<br />
phool khurshid ae khilda rawe<br />
raazi sarwar te mehshar de din<br />
dukhi zainab di maa howe<br />
maula mera vi ghar howe, uthe alma di chaa howe..(2)</p>
</p>